But right now, there is no good reason to use most of the crappy
artifact weapons.  Demonbane isn't more effective against Demons than
some of the "top
 weapons, and it's less effective against almost everything else.  So
it's basically a subset of Frostbrand/Grayswandir in abilities.

Instead, make the weapons non-overlapping in abilities.  Players won't
use a lot of weapons now because they aren't useful, and players aren't
stupid.

One could have artifact polearms, or distinguish the weapons so that
there's more than just a perfunctory difference in style and a damage
difference.  Note that people _do_ use Sunsword, Magicbane, Excalibur,
etc for reasons other than damage.

>   In fact, most players seem to be in favor of reducing the number of
